  - m_Id: 48343228070486016
    m_Localized: Attunement Gem
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48343228108234752
    m_Localized: 'Empowers this gauntlet''s basic and heavy attacks, depending on
      its element.

      Fire: basic attacks burn.

      Lightning: attacks chain
      to nearby enemies.

      Ice: attacks build frost; 10 stacks freeze.

      Earth:
      basic attacks resist interruption; heavy attacks charge slower and break easier.

      Wind:
      heavy attacks charge faster and hit harder the longer they charge.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
